      "writtenOn": "2026-09-30T06:50:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This mirrors the already-merged Control.Power.Cap and Control.OperatingClockSpeed, which both live on their own /xyz/openbmc_project/control/... object and link back via controlling/controlled_by, and it keeps the daemon that can actually perform the reset decoupled from whoever owns the inventory item.",
