      "writtenOn": "2026-09-30T06:50:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thanks for pointing this out. `PendingReset` returns to `None` once the daemon finishes the request either way, with request time failures reported as `NotAllowed` or `Unavailable`, and the eventual outcome observed through the controlled device\u0027s own state rather than this interface. I have updated the description accordingly",
      "parentUuid": "6f3875d4_bfa40fc8",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 28,
        "startChar": 38,
