        "id": 1002790
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-09-30T06:50:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The implementing daemon manages it. It never advertises `None` in `SupportedResetTypes` and rejects a write of it with `NotAllowed`; bmcweb only maps `SupportedResetTypes` onto `ResetType@Redfish.AllowableValues`.",
      "parentUuid": "edb85b89_5660321a",
